        "Now consider a slightly different way to approach this problem. \n",
        "\n",
        "We compare each item in the list, to the items to its right *only*. \n",
        "\n",
        "Each items has already been compared to the items to its left, so we don't need to repeat the operation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 34,
      "id": "594bc2c0",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
