      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "acea86cc",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**How does the amount of work an algorithm needs to do change as the size of the problem increases?**\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the central idea behind algorithmic complexity.\n",
        "\n",
        "Algorithmic complexity describes how the computational resources required by an algorithm change as the input size increases.\n",
        "\n",
        "We are particularly interested in two resources:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Time complexity:** How does the *number of operations* performed by an algorithm grow as the input gets larger?\n",
        "\n",
        "**Space complexity:** How does the *amount of additional memory* required by an algorithm grow as the input gets larger?\n",
        "\n",
        "We are not initially interested in measuring actual time in seconds. This depends on the computer, processor, programming language and implementation. Instead, we want to understand how the algorithm itself scales."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Example: Two sorting algorithms\n",
        "\n",
        "Suppose two students write different algorithms to sort a list.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Algorithm A takes 1 second to sort 100 numbers.\n",
        "- Algorithm B takes 2 seconds to sort 100 numbers.\n",
        "\n",
        "At first glance, Algorithm A looks better.\n",
        "\n",
        "However...\n",
        "\n",
        "- Algorithm A takes 100 seconds to sort 10,000 numbers.\n",
        "- Algorithm B takes 5 seconds to sort 10,000 numbers.\n",
        "\n",
        "Which algorithm would you rather use?\n",
        "\n",
        "The fastest algorithm for a small input is not necessarily the fastest algorithm for a large input.\n",
        "\n",
        "**The aim of complexity analysis is to understand how algorithms scale, rather than simply how quickly they run on one particular example.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "6b7a5375",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Measuring the work performed by an algorithm"
      ]
    },
    {
