        "1. How many times does the loop execute if the list contains 10 elements, 100 elements, 1,000 elements?\n",
        "2. What happens to the amount of work when the input size doubles?\n",
        "3. How would you describe the relationship between input size and the number of operations?\n",
        "\n",
        "We can describe this relationship as:\n",
        "\n",
        "$\\text{Number of operations} \\propto n$\n",
        "\n",
        "where $n$ represents the number of elements in the input.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is called **linear complexity**."
      ]
